== Trivia ==
* Every Slayer has at least one weapon that grants bonus damage against its respective mob type.
* The [[Terminator]] is the only Slayer Weapon that reduces a player stat, dividing {{stat|cc}} by 4.
* The Blaze Slayer line is the only one made of paired weapons, with one Dagger for each Hellion Shield attunement.
* The Vampire Slayer line uses {{Stat|Rift Damage}} instead of regular melee stats, so its weapons only function inside the [[Rift]].

